0","id":627002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/566515-aggravated-damage?p=626996#post626996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And everything else. Including buildings and pretty much most other supernaturals who aren't expecting volcanic activity in your territory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, just pinpointing the vampires and creating fire on them while they sleep would be a better tactic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T00:44:50-07:00","id":629672,"title":"","content":"Do you think it would be possible for a tongue of fire user to set his own claws/body on fire ( without getting damaged ) to make the fight agg claws vs agg claws?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7208-beltrajor","name":"beltrajor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T01:00:36-07:00","id":629681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>beltrajor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/566515-aggravated-damage?p=629672#post629672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you think it would be possible for a tongue of fire user to set his own claws/body on fire ( without getting damaged ) to make the fight agg claws vs agg claws?</div> </div> </div> </div>With the right fetish, certainly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T02:09:54-07:00","id":629713,"title":"","content":"I was thinking of doing it through influences only. Create+control+maybe strengthen may do the trick, I guess. Of course a glove fetish would do the trick but I think the rules for influences as they are now Would allow such thing. I seriously think influences are something that badly needs fixing, hopefully In next books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7208-beltrajor","name":"beltrajor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T03:06:28-07:00","id":629779,"title":"","content":"In gauru being on fire isn't a big deal. You heal faster than it can hurt you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T06:52:10-07:00","id":629869,"title":"","content":"Talking about influences, It you are 4 or 5, you can create the ressonant condition on anything, including yourself, so, as per RAW, I can raise my defense and/or health through strenghthen given I' ve previously become ressonant. Al I reading it right ( english is not my native language)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7208-beltrajor","name":"beltrajor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T12:38:45-07:00","id":630151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>beltrajor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/566515-aggravated-damage?p=629672#post629672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you think it would be possible for a tongue of fire user to set his own claws/body on fire ( without getting damaged ) to make the fight agg claws vs agg claws?</div> </div> </div> </div>Make a rank 3 or 4 fetish to be able to use the Fire Elemental Dread Power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T13:03:59-07:00","id":664658,"title":"","content":"I'll just leave this here...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Werewolf - The Forsaken Second Edition p.142</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/566515-aggravated-damage?p=630151#post630151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>URFARAH\u2019S BANE (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Father Wolf\u2019s death at the hands of his offspring was an event of vast consequences, a moment that sundered the worlds. This rite is but an echo of that moment.<br /> <b>Symbols: </b>Betrayal, Father Wolf\u2019s death, shattering, echoes<br /> <b>Sample Rite: </b>The chosen champion stands apart from her pack as the ritemaster anoints her cheeks with painted tears for the Great Wolf\u2019s death. The ritualists invoke loss and the breaking of bonds, drawing on the champion\u2019s own grief as she feels the bonds of pack and totem slip away. (Wits + Empathy)<br /> <b>Cost: </b>5 Essence<br /> <b>Action: </b>Extended (15 successes; each roll represents 10 minutes) Duration:Until sunrise<br /> <b>Success: </b>The rite targets a single Uratha present, enhancing <br /> her natural weaponry. For the duration of the rite\u2019s effects, she <br /> deals aggravated damage to other werewolves with her claws and <br /> bite. At the end of the rite\u2019s duration, the enhanced Uratha <br /> suffers a single point of aggravated damage herself and gains <br /> the Guilty Condition. Furthermore, for the duration of the <br /> rite\u2019s effects, the enhanced Uratha is cut from all pack-ties; <br /> she is not treated as a pack member for the benefits of Gifts, <br /> rites or totem advantages.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T15:59:21-07:00","id":664928,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the rite was mentioned a few times throughout the thread before. Thanks for the Necro.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},